@baseUrl = http://localhost:5049/api/leadventures/dashboard
@accessToken = paste-admin-access-token-here

### Latest seven recorded transfer days
GET {{baseUrl}}/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Day report from LeadVentures database
GET {{baseUrl}}/daily?date=2026-10-12
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Weekly report from LeadVentures database (inclusive)
GET {{baseUrl}}/weekly?from=2026-10-05&to=2026-10-11
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Invalid date range: 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/weekly?from=2026-10-12&to=2026-10-05
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Missing required date: 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/daily
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### No authentication: 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/transfers
